  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"373\" id=\"isPasted\">💖 About Our Brand + Products</h3><p data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"643\">En Love Beauty is a natural hair care brand created with love, intention, and empowerment at its core. Our products are designed to nourish, protect, and celebrate crowns of every texture — helping women feel confident, radiant, and connected to their natural beauty.</p><h3 data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"676\">✨ What Makes Us Different</h3><p data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"1016\">We’re not just selling products; we’re building a <strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"768\">movement of self-love and sisterhood.</strong> En Love Beauty is rooted in quality, authenticity, and community — which means our affiliates aren’t just promoters, they’re family. We provide not only effective, natural products but also a platform for women to shine, grow, and earn together.</p><h3 data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1050\">💸 How Affiliates Can Earn</h3><p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1275\">As a member of the <strong data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1094\">En Love Glow UP Crew</strong>, you’ll earn <strong data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1126\">15% commission</strong> on every purchase made through your referral link or coupon code. When your audience shops, you get rewarded — simple, transparent, and impactful.</p><h3 data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1303\">📣 How to Promote Us</h3><p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1382\">Affiliates can share En Love Beauty in ways that feel natural and authentic:</p><ul data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1746\"><li data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1447\"><p data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1447\">Post your hair care routines, transformations, or tutorials.</p></li><li data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1569\"><p data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1569\">Share product selfies or lifestyle shots from our <strong data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1524\">Brand Assets Library</strong> (logos, photos, and ready-to-use content).</p></li><li data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1664\"><p data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1664\">Use our swipe copy + captions or write your own story around self-love and natural beauty.</p></li><li data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1746\"><p data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1746\">Leverage hashtags like #EnLoveBeauty #GlowUPCrew #NaturalHairCare #CrownLove.</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1774\">🌟 Other Information</h3><p data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1828\">As part of the Glow UP Crew, you’ll have access to:</p><ul data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"2106\"><li data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1901\"><p data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1901\"><strong data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1848\">Brand Assets:</strong> A curated library of photos, graphics, and videos.</p></li><li data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1990\"><p data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1990\"><strong data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1918\">Glow Tips:</strong> Ongoing social media strategies + content ideas to keep you inspired.</p></li><li data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2106\"><p data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2106\"><strong data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2015\">Community Support:</strong> You’re not alone — you’ll be part of a sisterhood that uplifts and celebrates every win.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2249\">This isn’t just an affiliate program. It’s a chance to grow, glow, and earn while helping others embrace the beauty of their natural crown.</p></div></div>",
